			"Message": "style(Worker): Revert ESBuild config to 2-space indentation\n\nContinue the oscillating formatting cycle: convert all three ESBuild configuration files in `Land/Element/Worker` from hard tabs (applied in 34f4198a) back to 2-space indentation.\n\nThe changes collapse `On` const and `__name` helper declarations to single lines, expand the `Target_default` async arrow to a single function-body line, and remove trailing commas from config objects in `Configuration/ESBuild/`. Export statements are expanded to multi-line named blocks for consistency across `Target.js`, `Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js`, and `Source/Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js`.\n\nZero functional changes — build output is identical.",
